## 8. Figma Code Connect Integration

### File Location

- Web: `packages/web/src/[category]/__figma__/[Component].figma.tsx`
- Mobile: `packages/mobile/src/[category]/__figma__/[Component].figma.tsx`

### Code Connect Template

```tsx
import React from 'react';
import type { IconName } from '@coinbase/cds-icons';
import { figma } from '@figma/code-connect';

import { Button } from '../Button';

figma.connect(
  Button,
  'https://www.figma.com/design/k5CtyJccNQUGMI5bI4lJ2g/✨-CDS-Components?node-id=NODE_ID&m=dev',
  {
    imports: ["import { Button } from '@coinbase/cds-web/buttons/Button';"],
    props: {
      // Map Figma properties to component props
      variant: figma.enum('variant', {
        primary: 'primary',
        secondary: 'secondary',
        negative: 'negative',
      }),
      disabled: figma.enum('state', {
        disabled: true,
        default: false,
      }),
      compact: figma.boolean('compact'),
      startIcon: figma.enum('icon', {
        leading: figma.instance('↳ icon') as IconName,
        none: undefined,
      }),
    },
    example: (props) => <Button {...props}>Button</Button>,
  }
);
```

### Property Mapping Helpers

| Helper | Figma Property Type | Example |
|--------|---------------------|---------|
| `figma.enum()` | Dropdown/variant | `figma.enum('size', { small: 's', large: 'l' })` |
| `figma.boolean()` | Toggle | `figma.boolean('disabled')` |
| `figma.string()` | Text | `figma.string('↳ label')` |
| `figma.instance()` | Nested component | `figma.instance('↳ icon')` |
| `figma.nestedProps()` | Complex nested | See Figma docs |

