## 9. Figma to Code Mapping

### Figma Design Tokens → CSS Variables

| Figma Token | CSS Variable |
|-------------|--------------|
| `color/bg-primary` | `--color-bgPrimary` |
| `color/fg-muted` | `--color-fgMuted` |
| `spacing/2` | `--space-2` |
| `radius/400` | `--borderRadius-400` |
| `typography/body` | `--fontSize-body`, `--fontWeight-body`, etc. |

### Common Figma Property → Prop Mappings

| Figma Property | CDS Prop | Values |
|----------------|----------|--------|
| `variant` | `variant` | primary, secondary, negative, positive |
| `state` | `disabled`, `loading` | Boolean from enum |
| `size` | `size` / `compact` | s, m, l or boolean |
| `width` | `block`, `flush` | full → block, flush → 'start' |
| `icon` | `startIcon`, `endIcon` | IconName from instance |

