## 10. Component Props Patterns

### Base Props (Shared)

```typescript
type SharedProps = {
  testID?: string;                    // For testing
  accessibilityLabel?: string;        // Screen reader label
};
```

### Web-Specific Props

```typescript
type WebProps = SharedProps & {
  className?: string;
  style?: React.CSSProperties;
  classNames?: { root?: string; [key: string]: string };
  styles?: { root?: React.CSSProperties; [key: string]: React.CSSProperties };
};
```

### Mobile-Specific Props

```typescript
type MobileProps = SharedProps & {
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>;
  styles?: { root?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>; [key: string]: StyleProp<any> };
};
```

### Style Props (Layout)

Both platforms support these via the `Box` component:

```typescript
type StyleProps = {
  // Spacing
  padding?: Space;
  paddingX?: Space;
  paddingY?: Space;
  margin?: Space;
  gap?: Space;
  
  // Layout
  display?: 'flex' | 'block' | 'inline' | 'grid' | 'none';
  flexDirection?: 'row' | 'column';
  alignItems?: 'flex-start' | 'center' | 'flex-end' | 'stretch';
  justifyContent?: 'flex-start' | 'center' | 'flex-end' | 'space-between';
  
  // Sizing
  width?: number | string;
  height?: number | string;
  
  // Colors (use token names)
  color?: ColorToken;         // e.g., 'fgPrimary'
  background?: ColorToken;    // e.g., 'bgSecondary'
  
  // Border
  borderRadius?: BorderRadiusToken;  // e.g., 400
  borderWidth?: BorderWidthToken;    // e.g., 100
  borderColor?: ColorToken;
};
```

