## 12. Figma MCP Workflow

### Getting Design Context

1. **Extract URL parts**: `https://figma.com/design/{fileKey}/{fileName}?node-id={nodeId}`
2. **Use MCP tools**:
   - `mcp_Figma_get_screenshot` - Visual reference
   - `mcp_Figma_get_design_context` - Code generation hints
   - `mcp_Figma_get_variable_defs` - Token mappings

### Implementation Checklist

When implementing a Figma design:

1. ☐ Get screenshot of the design
2. ☐ Identify component type and category
3. ☐ Map Figma properties to CDS props
4. ☐ Use correct CSS variables for tokens
5. ☐ Follow platform-specific patterns (Web/Mobile)
6. ☐ Create Figma Code Connect file
7. ☐ Add Storybook stories
8. ☐ Write unit tests

